    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="6">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Iudex">Iudex</ref> 6</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Forðon þonne ondræde he him God, his deman, ðy læs he eft on domes dæge beforan Godes eagum weorðe dumb 7 genyðerad.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Therefore let him fear God, his judge, lest later before the eyes of God on the [last] day of judgement he be made dumb and condemned.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Timeat omnis iudex ac diligat Deum, iudicem suum, ne in die iudicii mutus fiat et humiliatus ante oculos iudicis cuncta uidentis!</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
